    {
      "parameters": {
        "modelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "models/gemini-3-flash-preview"
        },
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are the AI Content Reviewer in ContentFlow AI.\n\nReview the generated content below.\n\nEvaluate:\n1. Relevance\n2. Clarity\n3. Engagement\n4. Platform suitability\n5. Originality\n6. Factual consistency\n7. CTA quality\n8. AI-sounding language\n\nScore from 1 to 10.\n\nDecision rules:\n- score >= 8 → APPROVE\n- score < 8 → REVISE\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON in exactly this structure:\n\n{\n  \"score\": 1,\n  \"decision\": \"APPROVE\",\n  \"feedback\": \"\",\n  \"issues\": [],\n  \"improvements\": []\n}\n\nRules:\n- score must be an integer from 1 to 10.\n- decision must be exactly \"APPROVE\" or \"REVISE\".\n- Do not invent facts.\n- Do not use markdown code fences.\n- Do not add extra keys.\n\nGenerated content:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.contentWriter) }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "jsonOutput": true,
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.googleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1456,
